  <name>Jelly</name>
  <summary>Watch your Jellyfin library</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.joaotroxo">
    <name>Joao Roxo</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Jelly is a native client for Jellyfin media servers. It plays every file
      as it is with mpv, so the server never has to transcode: MKV, 10-bit HEVC,
      AV1, Opus, FLAC, styled ASS subtitles with their fonts and PGS subtitles
      all play directly, with hardware decoding.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Continue Watching, Next Up and what's new in each library</li>
      <li>Resumes where you left off on any device, and reports what you watch back to Jellyfin</li>
      <li>Skips intros and recaps, and counts down to the next episode over the credits</li>
      <li>Picks audio and subtitle tracks by your Jellyfin language settings</li>
      <li>Requests what isn't in the library yet through Seerr, and shows how its download is going</li>
      <li>A command line for keyboard shortcuts and launchers</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

